/E (The Income Index calculates the standard of living using Gross National Income \(GNI\) per capita. The standard HDI technique generally expresses it in USD, but for this project, the value can also be reported in Kuwaiti Dinar \(KWD\) to ensure local relevance. Khaldiya's projected GNI per capita is at 16,000 KWD, or about $52,000 USD.)
